<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.African Feb gold output rises to 38.93 tonnes.</title>
<headline>S.African Feb gold output rises to 38.93 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African gold output rose in February to 38,926.8 kg from January's 38,388.5, Chamber of Mines figures show.  </p>
<p>Detailed figures in kilos (ozs in brackets) -</p>
<p>Feb 1997     Jan 1997     Feb 1996    Jan-Feb 97   Jan-Feb 96</p>
<p>38,926.8     38,388.5     42,794.4     77,315.3     82,143.1</p>
<p>(1.25 mln)  (1.23 mln)   (1.38 mln)    (2.49 mln)  (2.64 mln)</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
